        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jerusalem daeng khou Kalvary ching khou,",
            "Kanloumei Pu thingru khou zai thaupui bam;",
            "Khou tei Bumaeng Thanmei rui duang gutro.",
            "",
            "Hou khang ning e kanloumei Pu ta,",
            "Kaphaai kabaan kanaek khou zam tei rui;",
            "Nkhuaimei azaeng khou rui khaengh lou the.",
            "",
            "2. Juda daihmei nunle amuh nun tei rui,",
            "Sinnui lana zau bam Zion pi lung khou;",
            "Siangding thingru khou tei hianbinlou the.",
            "",
            "3. Guangna zaulo kanloumei Pu nzaenghmei,",
            "Rianra rianriu khangna zion pilung khou;",
            "Simei rui gumliamna kazau si the.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkao Guangh Na theih nung ‘thanmei nun chunsi,",
            "Kaniu Guangh theihmei ta zau ngammei makge;",
            "Poubaomei theipui nung kandi zing e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
